(7721606, 1270651, 91360, '<td valign="top">love your perspective! great for the challenge!</td>', 'love your perspective! great for the challenge!', '2022-06-15 00:20:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734894, 1270469, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a harsh finishing place! The composition is actually excellent for such a difficult shot and I like the idea behind it.<br/> <br/>I think all that lets it down is perhaps the image quality itself, it''s a little noisy and out of focus.<br/> <br/>But it''s good to get your first contest under your belt! You have a good eye and ideas it seems, I look forward to seeing you in future challenges.</td>', 'This is a harsh finishing place! The composition is actually excellent for such a difficult shot and I like the idea behind it. I think all that lets it down is perhaps the image quality itself, it''s a little noisy and out of focus. But it''s good to get your first contest under your belt! You have a good eye and ideas it seems, I look forward to seeing you in future challenges.', '2022-12-18 13:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734899, 1270550, 29535, '<td valign="top">The camera is struggling a bit with that sky there, it''s always tough with direct sunlight.<br/> <br/>The railing in the bottom is an unfortunate distraction too.<br/> <br/>But the subject is a good choice and another good idea for a challenge. Try a little wider next time for the shot, let the subject breathe a bit. Remember the rule of thirds goes both horizontally and vertically and you''ll have a solid composition!</td>', 'The camera is struggling a bit with that sky there, it''s always tough with direct sunlight. The railing in the bottom is an unfortunate distraction too. But the subject is a good choice and another good idea for a challenge. Try a little wider next time for the shot, let the subject breathe a bit. Remember the rule of thirds goes both horizontally and vertically and you''ll have a solid composition!', '2022-12-18 13:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734904, 1270666, 29535, '<td valign="top">Don''t be disheartened, it was a bold idea to try this out and I hope to see you back again for future challenges!</td>', 'Don''t be disheartened, it was a bold idea to try this out and I hope to see you back again for future challenges!', '2022-12-18 13:39:08.000000', NULL, 0);
